 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "performances is a list of [singer, role, year] string triples (year is a decimal integer string); period >= 0. For each singer and each unordered pair of different roles A and B, the pair co-occurs for that singer when the singer has a performance of A and a performance of B whose years differ by at most period. Each singer for which a pair co-occurs adds 1 to the count of (A, B) and 1 to the count of (B, A). Return [A, B, count as a decimal string] for every ordered pair with a positive count, ordered by A then B in code-point order.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
